  "title": "Report Phishing Email",
  "original_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p>York University community members are frequent targets of phishing attacks. You—the user—have an important role to play in keeping your data safe from compromise.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Does The Report Phishing Button Work?</h2>\n<p>If you receive an email that you believe is a phishing attempt or spam, open or preview the message and then click the “Report Phishing” button. The suspicious email and its header information are bundled and forwarded to Information Security in a way that preserves headers and other information needed for threat analysis and response. The reported message will be automatically deleted from your inbox.</p>\n<p>If you accidentally report a message, you can find the email in the Deleted Items folder.</p>\n<p>By reporting suspicious email messages, you help reduce the success of potential malicious campaigns.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tabs alignnone\"><div class=\"kt-tabs-wrap kt-tabs-id337_ce33c5-1d kt-tabs-has-4-tabs kt-active-tab-4 kt-tabs-layout-tabs kt-tabs-tablet-layout-inherit kt-tabs-mobile-layout-inherit kt-tab-alignment-center\"><ul class=\"kt-tabs-title-list\"><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-1 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"tab-strongoutlookclientstrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-1\" data-tab=\"1\" href=\"#tab-strongoutlookclientstrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>Outlook Client</strong></span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-2 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"tab-strongoutlookwebmailstrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-2\" data-tab=\"2\" href=\"#tab-strongoutlookwebmailstrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>Outlook Webmail</strong></span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-3 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"tab-strongoutlookmobilestrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-3\" data-tab=\"3\" href=\"#tab-strongoutlookmobilestrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>Outlook Mobile</strong></span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-4 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-active\" id=\"tab-stronggmailstrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-4\" data-tab=\"4\" href=\"#tab-stronggmailstrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>Gmail</strong></span></a></li></ul><div class=\"kt-tabs-content-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-1 kt-inner-tabf19f79-ba\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p>As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the <strong>Report Phishing</strong> ribbon. See below illustrations.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-338\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"652\" sizes=\"(max-width: 782px) 100vw, 782px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-3-45-18-PM-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-3-45-18-PM-1.jpg 782w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-3-45-18-PM-1-400x334.jpg 400w\" width=\"782\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-344\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"271\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg 760w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1-400x143.jpg 400w\" width=\"760\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder.</strong></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-2 kt-inner-tab20f20c-f1\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">To report a suspicious email, click on the <strong>More apps</strong> icon</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-342\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"555\" sizes=\"(max-width: 902px) 100vw, 902px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-27-47-PM.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-27-47-PM.jpg 902w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-27-47-PM-400x246.jpg 400w\" width=\"902\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click <strong>Report Phishing</strong> button.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-343\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"141\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-28-13-PM.jpg\" width=\"296\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-344\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"271\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg 760w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1-400x143.jpg 400w\" width=\"760\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder.</strong></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-3 kt-inner-tabc25033-90\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tabs alignnone\"><div class=\"kt-tabs-wrap kt-tabs-id337_e3f49a-a6 kt-tabs-has-2-tabs kt-active-tab-2 kt-tabs-layout-vtabs kt-tabs-tablet-layout-inherit kt-tabs-mobile-layout-inherit kt-tab-alignment-center\"><ul class=\"kt-tabs-title-list\"><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-1 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-inactive\" id=\"tab-strongandroidstrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-1\" data-tab=\"1\" href=\"#tab-strongandroidstrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>Android</strong></span></a></li><li class=\"kt-title-item kt-title-item-2 kt-tabs-svg-show-always kt-tabs-icon-side-right kt-tab-title-active\" id=\"tab-strongiosstrong\"><a class=\"kt-tab-title kt-tab-title-2\" data-tab=\"2\" href=\"#tab-strongiosstrong\"><span class=\"kt-title-text\"><strong>IOS</strong></span></a></li></ul><div class=\"kt-tabs-content-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-1 kt-inner-tab67dc26-f5\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p>Click on the three vertical dots:</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-347\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 467px) 100vw, 467px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_Outlook.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_Outlook.jpg 467w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_Outlook-300x400.jpg 300w\" width=\"467\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click the <strong>Report Phishing </strong>button.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-348\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"321\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 705px) 100vw, 705px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-141037_Outlook-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-141037_Outlook-1.jpg 705w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-141037_Outlook-1-400x182.jpg 400w\" width=\"705\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-349\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"623\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 467px) 100vw, 467px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-143515_Outlook.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-143515_Outlook.jpg 467w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-143515_Outlook-300x400.jpg 300w\" width=\"467\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted </strong><strong>Items folder</strong>.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-2 kt-inner-tab818860-75\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p>Click on the three vertical dots <strong>...</strong></p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-352\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3455.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3455.jpg 450w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3455-225x400.jpg 225w\" width=\"450\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click on the <strong>Report Phishing </strong>button.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-353\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3456.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3456.jpg 450w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3456-225x400.jpg 225w\" width=\"450\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-354\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3458.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3458.jpg 450w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3458-225x400.jpg 225w\" width=\"450\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted </strong><strong>Items folder</strong>.</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n<p></p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-tab kt-tab-inner-content kt-inner-tab-4 kt-inner-tab5af0c7-7f\"><div class=\"kt-tab-inner-content-inner\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the \"Report Phish Button\"</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2701\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"725\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1731px) 100vw, 1731px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic.png 1731w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-400x168.png 400w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-1024x429.png 1024w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-1536x643.png 1536w\" width=\"1731\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click Report.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2703\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"715\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-2.0-1.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-2.0-1.png 488w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-2.0-1-273x400.png 273w\" width=\"488\"/></figure>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">You're set! Reporting suspicious emails helps prevent your data from being compromised.</p>\n</div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"entry-links\"></div>\n</div>",
  "html": "\n<p>York University community members are frequent targets of phishing attacks. You—the user—have an important role to play in keeping your data safe from compromise.</p>\n<h2>How Does The Report Phishing Button Work?</h2>\n<p>If you receive an email that you believe is a phishing attempt or spam, open or preview the message and then click the “Report Phishing” button. The suspicious email and its header information are bundled and forwarded to Information Security in a way that preserves headers and other information needed for threat analysis and response. The reported message will be automatically deleted from your inbox.</p>\n<p>If you accidentally report a message, you can find the email in the Deleted Items folder.</p>\n<p>By reporting suspicious email messages, you help reduce the success of potential malicious campaigns.</p>\n<h2>Outlook Client</h2>\n<p>As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the <strong>Report Phishing</strong> ribbon. See below illustrations.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-3-45-18-PM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder.</strong></p>\n<h2>Outlook Webmail</h2>\n<p>To report a suspicious email, click on the <strong>More apps</strong> icon</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-27-47-PM.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report Phishing</strong> button.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-19-2022-4-28-13-PM.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click <strong>Report</strong>. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/7-21-2022-11-41-25-AM-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted Items folder.</strong></p>\n<h2>Outlook Mobile</h2>\n<p>As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it.</p>\n<h2>Android</h2>\n<p>Click on the three vertical dots:</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_Outlook.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click the <strong>Report Phishing </strong>button.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-141037_Outlook-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/Screenshot_20220719-143515_Outlook.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted </strong><strong>Items folder</strong>.</p>\n<h2>IOS</h2>\n<p>Click on the three vertical dots <strong>...</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3455.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>Click on the <strong>Report Phishing </strong>button.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3456.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p>A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2023/07/IMG_3458.jpg\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the <strong>Deleted </strong><strong>Items folder</strong>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>Gmail</h2>\n<p>As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the \"Report Phish Button\"</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic.png\"/></figure>\n<p>Click Report.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2026/05/ypa-button-website-demo-pic-2.0-1.png\"/></figure>\n<p>You're set! Reporting suspicious emails helps prevent your data from being compromised.</p>\n<p></p>\n",
  "text": "York University community members are frequent targets of phishing attacks. You—the user—have an important role to play in keeping your data safe from compromise. How Does The Report Phishing Button Work? If you receive an email that you believe is a phishing attempt or spam, open or preview the message and then click the “Report Phishing” button. The suspicious email and its header information are bundled and forwarded to Information Security in a way that preserves headers and other information needed for threat analysis and response. The reported message will be automatically deleted from your inbox. If you accidentally report a message, you can find the email in the Deleted Items folder. By reporting suspicious email messages, you help reduce the success of potential malicious campaigns. Outlook Client Outlook Webmail Outlook Mobile Gmail As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it immediately by clicking the Report Phishing ribbon. See below illustrations. Click Report . A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review. Note: If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the Deleted Items folder. To report a suspicious email, click on the More apps icon Click Report Phishing button. Click Report . A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review. Note: If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the Deleted Items folder. As soon as you suspect that you received a phishing email, report it. Android IOS Click on the three vertical dots: Click the Report Phishing button. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review. Note: If you have mistakenly reported an email, you can retrieve it from the Deleted Items folder . Click on the three vertical dots ... Click on the Report Phishing button. A copy of the email will be sent to the Information Security Team for review. Note: If you have mistakenly reporte